{"version":1,"key":"card:401","content":{"id":401,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"补码具有如下特点："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首位表示符号位，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示正数，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示负数"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正数的表示同无符号数"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"加法的位运算同无符号数一致"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设对于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"x > 0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x > 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，其补码表示为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"[0, x_{w - 2}, x_{w-3}, \\dots, x_0]","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[0, x_{w - 1}, x_{w-2}, \\dots, x_0]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，设对于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"-x","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"-x"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其补码表示为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"[1, y_{w - 2}, y_{w - 3}, \\dots, y_0]","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[1, y_{w}, y{w - 1}, \\dots, y_0]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，研究序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\vec{x} = [x_{w - 2}, x_{w - 3}, \\dots, x_0]","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{x}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\vec{y} = [y_{w - 2}, y_{w - 3}, \\dots, y_0]","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{y}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的关系"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"x + (-x) = 0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"即 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"[0, x_{w - 2}, x_{w-3}, \\dots, x_0] + [1, y_{w - 2}, y_{w - 3}, \\dots, y_0] = [0, 0, 0, \\dots, 0]","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[0, x_{w - 1}, x_{w-2}, \\dots, x_0] + [1, y_{w}, y_{w - 1}, \\dots, y_0] = [0, 0, 0, \\dots, 0]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，要使得此式成立，有"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\vec{x} + \\vec{y} = [1_{w - 1}, 0, 0, \\dots, 0]","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"即"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2}x_i2^{i} + \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} y_i 2^{i} = 2^{w - 1}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"进行一个变换"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} y_i 2^i = (2^{w - 1} - 1 - \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2}x_i 2^{i}) + 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\vec{\\hat{x}}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{\\hat{x}}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿ 为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\vec{x}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{x}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿的反码，易知"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\sum_{i=0}^{w - 2} {\\hat{x}_i} 2^{i} + \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} x_i 2^{i} = 2^{w - 1} - 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} y_i 2^i = \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} \\hat{x}_i 2^{i} + 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"即 ","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\color{#1a66ff}\\vec{y}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{y}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的表示为 ","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\color{#1a66ff}\\vec{\\hat{x}} + 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{\\hat{x}} + 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，即 ","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\color{#1a66ff}\\vec{x}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{x}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的反码加 ","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\color{#1a66ff}1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现推导有符号数 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"x","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与其补码二进制表示 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\vec{x} = [x_{w - 1}, x_{w - 2}, \\dots, x_0]","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{y}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的关系。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"x \\geq 0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x \\geq 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"x_{w - 1} = 0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y_{w} = 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，此时有"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"x = \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 1} x_i 2^{i} = - x_{w - 1} 2^{w - 1} + \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} x_i 2^{i}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"x < 0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x < 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"x_{w - 1} = 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y_{i\\w - 1} = 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，设 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"z = -x > 0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"z = -x > 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，则"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2}z_i2^{i} + \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} x_i 2^{i} = 2^{w - 1}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"则"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nx = -z &= -\\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2}z_i2^{i} \\\\\n&= -2^{w - 1} + \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} x_i 2^{i} \\\\\n&= -x_{w - 1} 2^{w - 1} + \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} x_i 2^{i}\n\\end{aligned}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"综上，对任意 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"{-2^{w - 1} \\leq x \\leq 2^{w - 1} - 1}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"${-2^{w - 1} \\leq x \\leq 2^{w - 1} - 1}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，其二进制表示为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\vec{x} = [x_{w - 1}, x_{w - 2}, \\dots, x_0]","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\vec{y} = [y_{w - 1}, y_{w - 2}, \\dots, y_0]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，二者的关系为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\color{#1a66ff}x = -x_{w - 1} 2^{w - 1} + \\sum_{i = 0}^{w - 2} x_i 2^{i}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["编码/补码"],"createTime":1705713692573,"updateTime":1761351321046,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1761351321046}}